  "bodyHash": "6a64bc87a730fa75",
  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>请仅使用 Oh The Trees You Grow 版本 1.3.4/5.0.3 及以下版本！！！最新版本存在严重错误，尚未修复！请耐心等待 OTYG 作者进行修复！只有在新版本安全可用时，我才会更新模组依赖要求！</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>我已从默认关系（Default Relations）中移除 OTTYG，以阻止 CurseForge Launcher 下载最新版本。请仔细阅读说明！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Dreamwoods Redux</strong></span></span><strong style=\"color:#999\">是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dreamwoods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dreamwoods</a> 模组的极度精简分支，它仅使用原版方块，不添加任何新生物群系。为了获得更好的兼容性，生物群系的分布也未受影响。该模组改变了大多数原版生物群系的外观，通过更大、更逼真的树木以及一些其他小型植被和地形特征来增强它们。</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\">\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#169179\">Dreamwoods Redux 1.20.1</span> 提供 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">FORGE</span> 和 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">FABRIC</span> 版本。Fabric 版本需要 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>.</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\"><strong>此项目需要 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-trees-youll-grow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Trees You Grow</a> 1.3.4</span> 模组才能在 1.20.1 上运行，并在 1.21.1 上使用 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-trees-youll-grow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Trees You Grow</a> 5.0.3</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">*</span>。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\"><strong>此项目是我 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woodlands-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodlands</a> 系列及旧模组的灵性续作。这次的风格更加契合原版，而且树叶终于能正确腐烂了！*&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>* 除了棕榈树和垂柳，因为它们的叶子放置方式仍然不符合原版规则</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>* </strong></span><strong>确保你有足够的空间让树苗长成巨大的树木！在核心模组 <em>Oh The Trees You Grow</em> 1.3.4 或更早版本中，树木会摧毁沿途的所有方块！这对建筑物非常危险！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400;color:#999\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:22px\">已知问题和重要信息</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<ul>\n<li>旧版 <em>Oh The Trees You Grow (&lt;=1.3.4)</em> 的 bug：树木会摧毁路径上的其他树木和结构</li>\n<li>由于结构原因，某些树木的叶子不会腐烂，例如棕榈树、垂柳或多根灌木</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"color:#999\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">生物群系模组兼容性：</span></strong></h2>\n<p>应该与所有基于 Terrablender 制作的模组兼容。</p>\n<p>可能与基于数据包系统制作的模组不太兼容，因为它们会在某种程度上与 Dreamwoods 系统冲突：覆盖、更改或搞乱它，或者干脆导致其中一个无法工作。</p>\n<p>与非生物群系模组应该能很好地配合。</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">已测试兼容性：</span></strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\">Moderner Beta</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\">Tree Chop\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>将 \"maxBreakLeavesDistance\" 设置为更高的数值（10-13）以适应更大的树木，并将 \"ignorePersistentLeaves = false\" 以移除棕榈树和垂柳的叶子（如果需要的话）</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Tree Harvester</strong>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>\"ignorePlayerMadeTrees\": false（以移除棕榈树和垂柳的叶子）</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Panda Falling Tree</strong>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>\"maxLeavesRadius\": 10, \"maxLogAmount\": 500, \"shouldFallOnMaxLogAmount\": false, \"shouldIgnorePersistentLeaves\": false（以移除棕榈树和垂柳的叶子）</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Biomes O'Plenty</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>Regions Unexplored</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>Oh The Biomes We've Gone</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>Tectonic</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Quark</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mystic's Biomes</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Autumnity</strong></li>\n<li><strong>River Redux</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Swampier Swamps</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Alex Caves</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Yung's Caves</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Geophyllic Reforged</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Nature Arise</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Terralith</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">部分兼容/未按预期工作：</span></strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>WWOO (</strong><strong>William Wyther's Overhauled Overworld)&nbsp; <em>- 可以工作，但生物群系外观可能不可预测</em></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>WWEE (</strong><strong>William Wyther's Expanded Ecosphere</strong><strong>) -&nbsp;<em> 可以工作，但生物群系外观可能不可预测</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Trees <em>(仅原版树木会发生变化)</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Let's Do Blooming Nature -&nbsp;<em>生物群系混乱，外观可能不可预测</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">不兼容：</span></strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Litosphere</span> <em>(无法创建世界)</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9;font-size:22px\">生物群系截图</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>花森林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300890/description_52ac4015-1864-4fa2-a150-a48067395013.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>积雪针叶林</strong></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6f244388-f7ee-4ca3-afd9-8e08665b2cd1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>树林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_96605d99-0c13-44bd-8947-f5b839299b3e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>向日葵平原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1210345-80bf-441c-ba13-8f2ad6a1a22c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>热带草原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b32c4be1-a050-49b1-bd4e-17dbd4484e6e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>热带高原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c057ca1d-b84e-4aef-8346-e4d7a921799f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>沙漠（“绿洲”）</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_66ed1754-ee0b-475e-93c1-b9873e5ef0f8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>风袭热带草原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e855b668-c319-4d09-874c-cc9bb250a8e2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>红树林沼泽</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219645/description_0ba9fe77-55d2-4375-9474-adedd0a0a509.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>老生长针叶林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ddcf5607-752f-4a6b-9b16-94c3d78b6013.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>沼泽</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9451ff09-c5cc-4e1e-a780-11aa0746322d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>森林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_676e5b80-cc50-43bc-9705-0d880e9e0128.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>风袭森林和风袭丘陵</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9b6f2d1e-b38c-40c0-968e-4fd88d9cfec2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>针叶林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5072fb1b-d0ef-4062-a6ab-9e3634ab7d0d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>古老桦木林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_11483ffd-2ca7-4811-9b1f-e2bba90cf44d.png\" alt=\"桦木\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>桦木林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_282d99ec-449a-418d-8fb2-6988fff6f173.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>稀疏丛林和竹林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_831fb591-2655-42ee-8092-559d630ecb86.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>蘑菇岛</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ca11b3c5-fb4d-402f-888a-39c8d9984406.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>深色森林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_33ad1d4d-234b-4cb8-8f04-ff682c2af8f7.png\" alt=\"深色\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>樱花树林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0149bfe9-47b4-49e3-980c-5163ae42cd88.png\" alt=\"樱花\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>为什么版权保留（AllRightsReserved）？我可以将其包含在整合包中吗？我可以为了个人需求编辑数据吗？</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>版权保留是因为我的另一个模组被盗用，并以其他名称非法发布到 Modrinth。如果你看到相同的地形景观并认出这是出自另一位作者/名称的模组，请告诉我！</strong></li>\n<li><strong>是的，你可以将此模组包含在任何类型的整合包中。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>是的，如果你愿意，你可以编辑冲突的数据或标签，但仅限用于个人用途/整合包兼容性。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止重新发布。请避免从 curseforge.com 或 modrinth 以外的网站下载此模组。如果没有链接到原始的 CurseForge 页面，你不能发布此模组。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
